# Okasaki Quantum Data Structures & Lakefill `QSub` / `QPhys` Compiler Architecture

This self-contained, zero-`sorry`, zero-`axiom`, zero-`native_decide`, zero-wildcard,
zero-warning Lean 4.35.0 library formalizes hardware-calibrated quantum data structures,
multi-dialect reversible/quantum IR lowering (`CoreQDS -> HUGR -> ML-RevIR -> OpenQASM 3.0`),
universal substructural type laws (`U1–U4`), physical noise/crosstalk resource semiring
