    1. `kLinearLambda`: Quantitative linear $\lambda$-calculus & Presburger disjoint slice borrowing
    2. `kWithinApply`: Reversible Bennett conjugation $U V U^\dagger$ & lexical ancilla scoping
    3. `kInductiveIso`: Strictly positive inductive types $\mu X.\Sigma_i \tau_i(X)$, orthogonal pattern isometries & McBride $\partial_X T$ zippers
    4. `kCatamorphismFold`: Structural reversible fold over inductive types (trees, quantum walks, Chebyshev QSVT polynomials)
