       + `-154 Q` fewer qubits** than Chevignard et al. [2024]'s `1,050 Q` / `15.0B`).
    3. `RSA-4096` Coset (`3,976 Q`, `c_pad = 36`): **`11,049,299,920` `TempAND`s**
